## Blending an RGBA pen colour: red [255 0 0 128] over blue [0 0 255]
  Expected for one layer: (128, 0, 127, 255); for two layers: (192, 0, 63, 255).
  one stroke: (128, 0, 127, 255)
  corner where two separate strokes overlap: (192, 0, 64, 255)
  corner of one two-segment path: (128, 0, 127, 255)

## Flood fill at anti-aliased edges
Each shape is drawn one side at a time, then filled from its centre (4-connected).
Leaks: fill colour more than w/2 + 1.5 px outside the line. Gaps: no fill more than w/2 + 1.5 px inside.
Halo: pixels just inside the line that look more like the background than the fill or the line.

